{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>El who brings them out of Egypt.</b> This name that is with Him is mighty, and He showed signs in Egypt." "<b>Like the horns of a wild ox.</b> Like קרני ראם, and the meaning of תועפות is strength; likewise ותועפות הרים לו. It is also possible that its meaning is 'and the horns of mountains,' and וכסף תועפות לך, its meaning is 'and silver, the horns of mountains.' And לו is like ותרועת מלך בו, and the sense is that this El granted strength to Israel, and all this is because he is joined to the Name and seeks only from Him, for they have no need for a soothsayer and diviner."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:11.888919135Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}